                <h3>Field Descriptions</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>id</strong>: Unique identifier for the query</li>
                    <li><strong>category</strong>: One of 9 agricultural knowledge categories</li>
                    <li><strong>query</strong>: The actionable question for evaluation</li>
                    <li><strong>source_doc_ids</strong>: List of source document identifiers</li>
                    <li><strong>provenance</strong>: Metadata about query generation and review process</li>
                    <li><strong>notes</strong>: Optional additional context or annotations</li>
                </ul>

