                <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
                
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>What is the source of the data?</h3>
                    <p>Our data comes from the CropWizard document corpus, which includes 400K+ publications from extension websites of 55+ U.S. land-grant universities, similar documents from other universities, and open-access research publications from agricultural journals. We only use the PDF documents from this corpus.</p>
                </div>
