                <div class="card">
                    <h3>How were seed queries curated and reviewed?</h3>
                    <p>Seed queries were generated using an LLM (GPT-4.1) from retrieved text chunks, then automatically clustered to remove redundancy. The clustered queries underwent manual review by agricultural experts to ensure quality, accuracy, and practical relevance. This process resulted in 2,500+ high-quality, actionable questions across nine agricultural categories.</p>
                </div>
