                <div class="card">
                    <h3>What makes AI-AgriBench different from other benchmarks?</h3>
                    <p>AI-AgriBench is unique in several ways: (1) It's derived from real agricultural extension knowledge rather than synthetic data, (2) Questions are designed to be actionable and farmer-oriented, (3) It covers comprehensive agricultural domains with expert curation, and (4) It provides transparent methodology for reproducibility and extension.</p>
