                    <p>We welcome contributions in several areas: (1) Submitting model results to our leaderboard, (2) Providing feedback on dataset quality, (3) Suggesting additional agricultural categories or question types, and (4) Contributing to our evaluation methodology. Please contact us to discuss collaboration opportunities.</p>
