                <div class="card">
                    <h3>What evaluation metrics are used?</h3>
                    <p>We use three primary metrics: (1) Exact Match (EM) for exact answer matching, (2) F1 Score for token-level overlap, and (3) Composite Score combining EM and F1 with agricultural relevance factors. Detailed metric definitions are available in the Evaluation section.</p>
                </div>
