                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Quick Answers</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>When will the dataset be released?</strong> Upon paper acceptance, expected in 2025.</li>
                        <li><strong>Can I use the dataset for commercial purposes?</strong> Commercial use requires explicit permission and licensing.</li>
                        <li><strong>How can I submit model results?</strong> Follow our evaluation guidelines and submit via our platform (coming soon).</li>
                        <li><strong>Is the code available?</strong> Code repository will be released alongside the dataset.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>For more detailed answers, please see the FAQ section above.</p>
